# The Price of Peace (Windurst 1-3): Windurst Woods. A level 10 Warrior of Windurst who has completed 1-1 and 1-2 (a
# GM). Section 1: Rakoh Buuma plays 114; its finish with option 2 begins the mission. Section 2 (1-3 current):
# Rakoh Buuma plays 150; The Heart of the Matter's last section (no NONE check in the Lua, a kept bug) answers first:
# Miiri-Wohri plays 118, Sola Jaab 117 and Tih Pikeh 119. Status 4 (a GM): Rakoh Buuma plays 154, whose finish completes
# the mission. Completed: Miiri-Wohri, Sola Jaab and Tih Pikeh play 157, 158 and 131. Rival zone-in: entering Windurst
# Woods plays the Seekers of Adventure mission Rumors from the West, 839 (another mission's script, not this one); its
# finish writes that mission's status 4 (area 12).
lists WindurstWoods/Rakoh_Buuma/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Miiri-Wohri/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Sola_Jaab/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Tih_Pikeh/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/114 WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/154
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=108,-5,-24 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=2
mission Rov Resonance current
login
mission Windurst TheHorutotoRuinsExperiment current
mission Windurst TheHorutotoRuinsExperiment completed   # a GM: 1-1 done
mission Windurst TheHeartOfTheMatter current
mission Windurst TheHeartOfTheMatter completed          # a GM: 1-2 done
trigger Rakoh_Buuma                     # section 1: 114
finish option=2                         # begun (status 1)
trigger Miiri-Wohri                     # section 2: The Heart of the Matter's 118
finish
trigger Rakoh_Buuma                     # 150
finish
trigger Sola_Jaab                       # The Heart of the Matter's 117
finish
trigger Tih_Pikeh                       # The Heart of the Matter's 119
finish
missionstatus Windurst 4                # a GM
trigger Rakoh_Buuma                     # status 4: 154
finish                                  # completed (1000 gil, rank 2)
trigger Miiri-Wohri                     # completed: 157
finish
trigger Sola_Jaab                       # 158
finish
trigger Tih_Pikeh                       # 131
finish
